yaml:
entry:
  entry_name: Hegh
  slug: Hegh_v
  part_of_speech: v:t,klcp1
  pos: v
  pos_subtype: t
  metadata_tags:
  - klcp1
  status: canonical
  section: main
  definition: die
  antonyms: '{yIn:v}'
  see_also: '{bogh:v}, {HoH:v}, {jub:v}, {jubbe'':v}'
  notes: The fact that {yIn:v} can be used transitively suggests that {Hegh:v:nolink}
    can be too.
  examples: '

    ▶ {batlh bIHeghjaj.:sen}

    ▶ {bISuvtaHvIS bIHeghjaj!:sen}

    ▶ {bItuHpa'' bIHeghjaj.:sen}

    ▶ {Dajonlu''pa'' bIHeghjaj.:sen}

    ▶ {batlh Heghlu''chugh noDnISbe'' vay''.:sen}

    ▶ {bIDIlbe''chugh vaj bIHegh!:sen}

    ▶ {bIjeghbe''chugh vaj bIHegh!:sen}

    ▶ {bIje''be''chugh vaj bIHegh!:sen}

    ▶ {bIHeghvIpchugh bIHeghpu''.:sen}

    ▶ {bogh tlhInganpu'', SuvwI''pu'' moj, Hegh.:sen}

    ▶ {DujDaj HubtaHvIS Hegh ''e'' tul Hoch tlhIngan.:sen}

    ▶ {Qu''Daj ta''taHvIS Hegh ''e'' tul Hoch tlhIngan.:sen}

    ▶ {wo'' toy''taHvIS Hegh ''e'' tul Hoch tlhIngan.:sen}

    ▶ {qanchoHpa'' qoH, Hegh qoH.:sen}

    ▶ {QamvIS Hegh qaq law'' torvIS yIn qaq puS.:sen}

    ▶ {QI''tomerDaq Heghpu'' Hoch.:sen}

    ▶ {reH Hegh yoHwI''pu''''e''.:sen}

    ▶ {wej Heghchugh vay'', SuvtaH SuvwI''.:sen}

    ▶ {yIlop! wa''leS chaq maHegh!:sen}

    ▶ {Hagh qoHpu'' neH HeghtaHvIS SuvwI''pu''.:sen}

    ▶ {HeghDI'' SuvwI'' nargh SuvwI'' qa''.:sen}

    ▶ {Heghlu''DI'' mobbe''lu''chugh QaQqu'' Hegh wanI''.:sen}

    ▶ {Heghlu''meH QaQ jajvam.:sen}

    ▶ {Hoch DaSopbe''chugh batlh bIHeghbe''.:sen}'
  sources:
    raw: '[1] {TKD:src}'
    citations:
    - source: tkd
  translations:
    de:
      definition: sterben
      notes: Die Tatsache, dass {yIn:v} transitiv verwendet werden kann, legt nahe,
        dass {Hegh:v:nolink} dies auch sein kann.
    fa:
      definition: مردن، فوت کردن
    sv:
      definition: dö
    ru:
      definition: Умирать
      notes: Фактически {yIn:v} может быть использована транзитивно. Как и {Hegh:v:nolink}.
    zh_HK:
      definition: 死
    pt:
      definition: morrer
    fi:
      definition: kuolla
    fr:
      definition: mourir

entry:
  entry_name: rur
  slug: rur_v
  part_of_speech: v:t_c,klcp1
  pos: v
  pos_subtype: t_c
  metadata_tags:
  - klcp1
  status: canonical
  section: main
  definition: resemble
  see_also: '{rap:v}, {nIb:v}, {... X law'' ... X puS:sen}'
  notes: This verb is used to form similes, such as {puj verengan; bIQ rur@@puj:v,
    verengan:n, bIQ:n, rur:v} "the Ferengi is as weak as water".[2; 4] It can also
    be used to translate "like" in the sense of "looks like".[3]
  hidden_notes: Possibly a reference to the science fiction play R.U.R. (Rossum's
    Universal Robots) by Karel Čapek.
  examples: '

    ▶ {bIr; bortaS rur@@bIr:v, bortaS:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {bIt; tI''qa'' vIghro'' rur@@bIt:v, tI''qa'' vIghro'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {boch; ghIch rur@@boch:v, ghIch:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {Dejpu''bogh Hov rur qablIj!:sen}

    ▶ {Dogh; tIghla'' rur@@Dogh:v, tIghla'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {ghung; qagh rur@@ghung:v, qagh:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {Hem; tlhIngan rur@@Hem:v, tlhIngan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {Hoj; tera''ngan rur@@Hoj:v, tera''ngan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {HoS; ''Iw rur@@HoS:v, ''Iw:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {HoSghaj; mupwI'' rur@@HoSghaj:v, mupwI'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {jej; Daqtagh rur@@jej:v, Daqtagh:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {jejHa''; naH taj rur@@jejHa'':v, naH taj:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {jeD; ghevI'' rur@@jeD:v, ghevI'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {let mInDu''Daj; Separmey rur@@let:v, mIn:n, -Du'':n, -Daj:n, Separ:n, -mey:n,
    rur:v}

    ▶ {lo''laHbe''; chetvI'' chIm rur@@lo''laHbe'':v, chetvI'':n:1, chIm:v, rur:v}

    ▶ {lugh; Sor rur@@lugh:v, Sor:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {matlhHa''; romuluSngan rur@@matlhHa'':v, romuluSngan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {mIgh; molor rur@@mIgh:v, molor:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {naS; norgh rur@@naS:v, norgh:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {nong; vulqangan rur@@nong:v:1, vulqangan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {ngo''; QI''tu'' rur@@ngo'':v, QI''tu'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {puj; bIQ rur@@puj:v, bIQ:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {qan; QI''tu'' rur@@qan:v:1, QI''tu'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {qej; veqlargh rur@@qej:v, veqlargh:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {qur; verengan rur@@qur:v, verengan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {quvHa''; ghe''tor ngan rur@@quvHa'':v, ghe''tor:n, ngan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {ram; ghIlab ghew rur@@ram:v, ghIlab ghew:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {Sagh; Ho''''oy'' rur@@Sagh:v, Ho''''oy'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {tam; Hew rur@@tam:v:1, Hew:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {tun; reghuluS ''Iwghargh rur@@tun:v, reghuluS ''Iwghargh:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {tlhab; ngem Ha''DIbaH rur@@tlhab:v, ngem Ha''DIbaH:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {tlhIb; toppa'' rur@@tlhIb:v, toppa'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {val; Huy'' rur@@val:v, Huy'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {wIH; Hur''Iqngan rur@@wIH:v, Hur''Iqngan:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {wov; ghI''boj Sech rur@@wov:v, ghI''boj:n, Sech:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {yuD; jey''naS rur@@yuD:v, jey''naS:n, rur:v}

    ▶ {yuDHa''; ghIt rur@@yuDHa'':v, ghIt:n:0, rur:v}

    ▶ {''IQ; rav rur@@''IQ:v, rav:n:1, rur:v}

    ▶ {''oj; bomwI'' rur@@''oj:v, bomwI'':n, rur:v}

    ▶ {''up; yIH rur@@''up:v, yIH:n, rur:v}'
  search_tags: like
  sources:
    raw: '[1] {TKD:src}, [2] {KGT p.127:src}, [3] {s.k 1999.01.04:src}, [4] {HQ 13.1,
      p.8-10, Mar. 2004:src}'
    citations:
    - source: tkd
    - source: kgt
      page_start: 127
    - source: startrek_klingon
      date: '1999-01-04'
    - source: holqed
      page_start: 8
      page_end: 10
      volume: 13
      issue: 1
      date: Mar. 2004
  translations:
    de:
      definition: ähneln, gleichen
    fa:
      definition: شبیه به
    sv:
      definition: likna, påminna om
    ru:
      definition: походить на кого-то, иметь сходство, быть похожим на
      notes: Этот глагол используется для формирования сравнений, например {puj verengan;
        bIQ rur@@puj:v, verengan:n, bIQ:n, rur:v} "Ференги слабые, как вода".[2; 4]
        Также может использоваться, чтобы перевести "как" в смысле "выглядит как".[3]
      search_tags: как, выглядит как
    zh_HK:
      definition: 類似
    pt:
      definition: assemelhar-se
    fi:
      definition: muistuttaa
    fr:
      definition: ressembler à

entry:
  entry_name: '''oH'
  slug: '''oH_n'
  part_of_speech: n:pro,klcp1
  pos: n
  pos_subtype: pro
  metadata_tags:
  - klcp1
  status: canonical
  section: main
  definition: it
  see_also: '{ghaH:n:pro}, {-Daj:n}'
  notes: 'The plural of this pronoun is {bIH:n:pro}.


    Verb prefixes when {''oH:n:nolink} is the subject:

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{pagh:n:1h} = {0:v:pref}

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{jIH:n:1h} = {mu-:v:pref}

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{maH:n:1h} = {nu-:v:pref}

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{SoH:n} = {Du-:v:pref}

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{tlhIH:n} = {lI-:v:pref}

    ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}/{chaH:n}/{bIH:n} = {0:v:pref}


    Verb prefixes when {''oH:n:nolink} is the object:

    ▶ {jIH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {vI-:v:pref}

    ▶ {maH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {wI-:v:pref}

    ▶ {SoH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {Da-:v:pref}

    ▶ {tlhIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {bo-:v:pref}

    ▶ {ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {0:v:pref}

    ▶ {chaH:n}/{bIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {lu-:v:pref}


    The imperative verb prefix when {''oH:n:nolink} is the object is {yI-:v:pref}.'
  hidden_notes: The Russian word for "it" is "он" (which looks like {'oH:n:nolink}
    when written in Cyrillic script).
  sources:
    raw: '[1] {TKD:src}, [2] {Saarbrücken qepHom''a'' 2018:src}'
    citations:
    - source: tkd
    - source: qephom_2018
      date: '2018'
  translations:
    de:
      definition: es
      notes: 'Der Plural dieses Pronomens ist {bIH:n:pro}.


        Verbpräfixe mit {''oH:n:nolink} als Subjekt:

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{pagh:n:1h} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{jIH:n:1h} = {mu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{maH:n:1h} = {nu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{SoH:n} = {Du-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{tlhIH:n} = {lI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}/{chaH:n}/{bIH:n} = {0:v:pref}


        Verbpräfixe mit {''oH:n:nolink} als Objekt:

        ▶ {jIH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {vI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {maH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {wI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {SoH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {Da-:v:pref}

        ▶ {tlhIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {bo-:v:pref}

        ▶ {ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {chaH:n}/{bIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {lu-:v:pref}


        Das Imperatif-Verbpräfix mit {''oH:n:nolink} als Objekt ist {yI-:v:pref}.'
    fa:
      definition: آن
    sv:
      definition: den, det
    ru:
      definition: оно (для неговорящих вещей)
      notes: 'Множественное число этого местоимения — {bIH:n:pro}.


        Глагольные префиксы, когда {''oH:n:nolink} является подлежащим:

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{pagh:n:1h} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{jIH:n:1h} = {mu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{maH:n:1h} = {nu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{SoH:n} = {Du-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{tlhIH:n} = {lI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}/{chaH:n}/{bIH:n} = {0:v:pref}


        Глагольные префиксы, когда {''oH:n:nolink} является дополнением:

        ▶ {jIH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {vI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {maH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {wI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {SoH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {Da-:v:pref}

        ▶ {tlhIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {bo-:v:pref}

        ▶ {ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {chaH:n}/{bIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {lu-:v:pref}


        Глагольный префикс повелительного наклонения, когда {''oH:n:nolink} является
        дополнением: {yI-:v:pref}.'
    zh_HK:
      definition: 它、牠
    pt:
      definition: ele/ela (objetos, seres não capazes de linguagem)
    fi:
      definition: se
    fr:
      definition: il/elle (choses, noms non capables de langue)
      notes: 'lepluriel de ce pronom est {bIH:n:pro}.


        Préfixes verbaux avec {''oH:n:nolink} comme sujet:

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{pagh:n:1h} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{jIH:n:1h} = {mu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{maH:n:1h} = {nu-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{SoH:n} = {Du-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{tlhIH:n} = {lI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {''oH:n:nolink}:{ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}/{chaH:n}/{bIH:n} = {0:v:pref}


        Préfixes verbaux avec {''oH:n:nolink} comme objet:

        ▶ {jIH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {vI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {maH:n:1h}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {wI-:v:pref}

        ▶ {SoH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {Da-:v:pref}

        ▶ {tlhIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {bo-:v:pref}

        ▶ {ghaH:n}/{''oH:n:nolink}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {0:v:pref}

        ▶ {chaH:n}/{bIH:n}:{''oH:n:nolink} = {lu-:v:pref}


        Le préfixe impératif avec {''oH:n:nolink} comme objet est {yI-:v:pref}.'

